      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Sadaiya!... Did you see?.. A girl raised in such wealth.. born and brought up in this palace of status and luxury, with a hundred servants ready at the flick of a finger and carrying out every command without refusal.. and the bridegroom says he will take her away to a mud hut... Is that fair?...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
